{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine the intensity of a 2D fighting game meeting the all-so-British elegance and sense of mastery of a Cricket match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's Super Cricket Fighter Turbo! A pixelated 1v1 arcade game where two players are clashing on the same screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a good friend, start a match, and FIGHT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mouse, keyboard, or gamepad controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nail-biting hard AI players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Training Coop Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juicy 8-bit art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dedicated insult button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's nothing like real cricket, but it's fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Cricket Fighter Turbo is a PC remaster of the first game we ever received a review for, 10 years ago~  <br>It was delisted from mobile stores over time, and we wanted to bring it back for that special occasion. <br>We hope you enjoy it as much as we enjoyed working on it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522620?t=1745577098","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522620?t=1745577098","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522620/4b27f02e03f9c7818cd1534c03fd6a15dcaf29da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745577098","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522620/4b27f02e03f9c7818cd1534c03fd6a15dcaf29da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745577098","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine the intensity of a 2D fighting game meeting the all-so-British elegance and sense of mastery of a Cricket match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's Super Cricket Fighter Turbo! A pixelated 1v1 arcade game where two players are clashing on the same screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a good friend, start a match, and FIGHT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mouse, keyboard, or gamepad controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nail-biting hard AI players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Training Coop Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juicy 8-bit art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dedicated insult button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's nothing like real cricket, but it's fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Cricket Fighter Turbo is a PC remaster of the first game we ever received a review for, 10 years ago~  <br>It was delisted from mobile stores over time, and we wanted to bring it back for that special occasion. <br>We hope you enjoy it as much as we enjoyed working on it!</p>","developers":["Sparkling Vinegar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i